---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import scene from "../../prototypes/assets/market-scene.svg?url";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Our local beginning"
  description="Meet The True Hive's Madisonville beginning: soap-making, beekeeping, and a collection of everyday goods taking shape at an honest pace."
>
  <section class="wrap story-page-intro" aria-labelledby="story-page-title">
    <div class="story-page-opening">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our beginning / Madisonville, Tennessee</p>
        <h1 id="story-page-title">
          A local beginning.
          <br />
          <em>Good things ahead.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="story-page-lede">
          Soap-making. Beekeeping. The possibility of a little collection that
          finds a place in the everyday.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/goods">
          Get to know the goods <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <figure class="story-page-illustration">
        <img
          src={scene}
          alt="Original concept illustration of The True Hive's imagined market stand."
          width="880"
          height="640"
        />
        <figcaption>
          A picture of the possibilities. Original illustration, not a real
          store, apiary, or product photograph.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section
    class="wrap story-page-beginning"
    aria-labelledby="story-page-beginning-title"
  >
    <div class="story-page-margin">
      <p class="eyebrow">01 / Close to home</p>
      <p class="story-page-place">
        Madisonville,
        <br />
        <em>Tennessee.</em>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="story-page-narrative">
      <h2 id="story-page-beginning-title">
        Everyday goods.
        <br />A story still being made.
      </h2>
      <p>
        The True Hive brings soap-making and beekeeping together in
        Madisonville. Soap leads the near-term collection, with honey and
        candles as future directions.
      </p>
      <p>
        This is a beginning, not a finished story. Real product information,
        photographs, and more about the making will be shared as the collection
        develops. For now, you can get to know the direction without mistaking
        an idea for something ready to buy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section
    class="story-page-directions"
    aria-labelledby="story-page-directions-title"
  >
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="story-page-section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">02 / Room to grow</p>
        <h2 id="story-page-directions-title">
          One beginning.
          <br />
          <em>A few possible paths.</em>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="story-page-collection">
        <article>
          <span class="story-page-index" aria-hidden="true">
            01
          </span>
          <h3>Soap, to start.</h3>
          <p>
            The starting point for the collection. Published product pages will
            distinguish confirmed information from design concepts.
          </p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/goods?category=soap">
            Explore soap <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="story-page-index" aria-hidden="true">
            02
          </span>
          <h3>Hive goods, ahead.</h3>
          <p>
            Honey availability is unconfirmed and candles remain planned.
            Illustrations offer a look at those possibilities, not stock.
          </p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/goods">
            See the collection <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span class="story-page-index" aria-hidden="true">
            03
          </span>
          <h3>Beekeeping, thoughtfully.</h3>
          <p>
            Colony removal and farm pollination are planned paths. Each needs
            its own assessment, confirmed scope, and capacity before any
            agreement.
          </p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/services">
            Read the service plans <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap story-page-next" aria-labelledby="story-page-next-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">03 / A local first step</p>
      <h2 id="story-page-next-title">
        A little closer.
        <br />
        <em>When it's ready.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="story-page-next-copy">
      <p>
        Local pickup is the plan for the first online collection. Exact
        arrangements come before purchasing opens; a public shop, collection
        hours, and shipping are not offered yet.
      </p>
      <p>
        Come for a look around now. Know what to expect before taking the next
        step.
      </p>
      <div class="story-page-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/goods">
          Explore the collection <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/#pickup">
          Read the pickup plan <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .story-page-intro {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem) 4rem;
  }
  .story-page-opening {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .story-page-opening h1 {
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 5.5vw, 5.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }
  .story-page-opening h1 em {
    letter-spacing: inherit;
  }
  .story-page-lede {
    max-width: 29rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .story-page-opening .text-link {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .story-page-illustration {
    padding: 1.25rem 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--forest);
  }
  .story-page-illustration img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 45% 45% 0 0;
    background: #eee7d6;
  }
  .story-page-illustration figcaption {
    max-width: 25rem;
    margin: 0.9rem auto 0;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .story-page-beginning,
  .story-page-next {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    gap: 2rem 5rem;
    padding-block: 4.5rem 5.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .story-page-place {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .story-page-place em {
    color: var(--tomato);
  }
  .story-page-narrative h2,
  .story-page-next h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.8vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
  }
  .story-page-narrative > p,
  .story-page-next-copy > p {
    max-width: 37rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.95;
  }
  .story-page-directions {
    padding-block: 4.5rem;
    color: var(--paper);
    background: var(--forest);
  }
  .story-page-section-heading {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .story-page-section-heading h2 {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.7vw, 4.25rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .story-page-section-heading h2 em {
    color: var(--ochre);
  }
  .story-page-collection {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 2.25rem;
  }
  .story-page-collection article {
    display: flex;
    min-width: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: start;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .story-page-index {
    color: var(--ochre);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  .story-page-collection h3 {
    margin-block: 1.5rem 1rem;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .story-page-collection p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.95;
  }
  .story-page-collection .text-link {
    margin-top: auto;
  }
  .story-page-collection a:focus-visible {
    outline-color: var(--ochre);
  }
  .story-page-next {
    padding-top: 5rem;
    border-top: 0;
  }
  .story-page-next h2 {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .story-page-next h2 em {
    color: var(--tomato);
  }
  .story-page-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 56rem) {
    .story-page-opening {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
    .story-page-opening > div {
      max-width: 40rem;
    }
    .story-page-illustration {
      width: min(100%, 33rem);
      margin-inline: auto;
    }
    .story-page-beginning,
    .story-page-next {
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .story-page-collection {
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 42rem) {
    .story-page-intro {
      padding-block: 3rem;
    }
    .story-page-opening h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 9.5vw, 4rem);
    }
    .story-page-beginning,
    .story-page-next,
    .story-page-collection {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .story-page-beginning,
    .story-page-next,
    .story-page-directions {
      padding-block: 3rem;
    }
    .story-page-place {
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .story-page-collection {
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .story-page-collection h3 {
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .story-page-section-heading {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
